# Source video originals. The hero loop shipped to the site is hero.mp4
# (7.4MB, 1280w CRF32); the 4K masters it was encoded from are not tracked.
*.mp4
!hero.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv

# Design sources and unused variants the site never references. All three
# stay on disk locally, they just aren't tracked.
